#autoload
#
# Completion for `gp pm`, the shorthand for `gp pr merge`. Rather than
# restate that grammar here and let the two drift apart, rewrite the word
# array into the form _gp-pr expects (`pr merge ...`) and hand off to it —
# so the shorthand always completes exactly like the command it stands for.
words=(pr merge "${(@)words[2,-1]}")
(( CURRENT += 1 ))
_gp-pr
